msgid "Follow system switches automatically from the current Windows app theme."
msgstr "跟隨系統會根據 Windows 當前的應用主題自動切換。"

msgid "Controls transparency and background blur for app panels and dialogs."
msgstr "影響應用面板與模態框的透明度和背景模糊程度。"

msgid "Show detailed fields like URL, checksum, threads in the download inspector."
msgstr "在下載檢查器中顯示 URL、校驗和、執行緒等詳細欄位。"

msgid "Start Limedl automatically when you log in. The app will start minimized to the system tray."
msgstr "登入系統時自動啟動 Limedl，啟動後將最小化到系統托盤。"

msgid "Action to perform when double-clicking a completed download task."
msgstr "設定雙擊已完成下載任務時的行為。"

msgid "Action to perform when double-clicking an uncompleted download task."
msgstr "設定雙擊未完成下載任務時的行為。"

msgid "New tasks will prefill this folder, and you can still override it per task."
msgstr "新建任務時會自動帶入該目錄，你仍然可以在任務裡臨時改掉。"

msgid "New tasks no longer show checksum mode separately. This setting is used globally."
msgstr "新建任務中不再單獨顯示校驗方式，統一使用這裡的設定。"

msgid "Automatically probe for matching .sha256 or parent SHA256SUMS files when downloading HTTP links, and verify after completion."
msgstr "下載 HTTP 連結時自動探測同名 .sha256 或目錄下的 SHA256SUMS 校驗檔案，完成後自動核對。"

msgid "New HTTP tasks prefill this UA, and each task can override it."
msgstr "新建 HTTP 任務會自動帶入該 UA，也可以在任務裡單獨覆蓋。"

msgid "Limit total download speed across all active tasks. 0 means unlimited."
msgstr "限制所有活躍任務的總下載速度。0 表示不限速。"

msgid "Supports common HTTP / HTTPS / SOCKS proxy URLs. Enter a full URL."
msgstr "支援常見 HTTP / HTTPS / SOCKS 代理地址，按完整 URL 填寫。"

msgid "Conservative limits thread growth, Balanced trades overhead for speed, and Aggressive prioritizes download speed."
msgstr "保守更偏節制執行緒，平衡兼顧開銷與速度，激進優先追求下載速度。"

msgid "Auto-adjust chunk strategy based on network conditions"
msgstr "根據網路狀況自動調整分塊策略"

msgid "Set to 0 to use 50% of the max thread count automatically. The adaptive algorithm never goes below this once reached."
msgstr "設為 0 則自動取最大執行緒數的 50%。到達最低值後自適應演算法不會繼續減執行緒。"

msgid "DHT discovers peers from the distributed network. Changes apply to the BT session after restart."
msgstr "DHT 會從分散式網路發現 Peer；修改後會在下次啟動的 BT 會話中生效。"

msgid "Leave empty for auto-assignment. 1024–65535"
msgstr "留空由系統自動分配。1024–65535"

msgid "Maximum peer connections per torrent."
msgstr "每個 torrent 的最大 peer 連線數。"

msgid "Download a TXT file from this URL, one tracker URL per line. Updating refreshes the list below; save settings afterward."
msgstr "從該地址下載 TXT，每行一個 Tracker URL。點選更新只會重新整理下方列表，仍需儲存設定。"

msgid "MSE/PE protocol encryption. Forced mode may reject unencrypted connections. irontide only."
msgstr "MSE/PE 協議加密。強制模式可能拒絕未加密連線。僅 irontide。"

msgid "Full preallocation reduces disk fragmentation but is slower on task creation. irontide only."
msgstr "完全預分配可減少磁碟碎片，但建立任務較慢。僅 irontide。"

msgid "Maximum number of auto-managed active downloads"
msgstr "自動管理的最大活躍下載任務數"

msgid "Maximum number of auto-managed active seeds"
msgstr "自動管理的最大活躍做種任務數"

msgid "Maximum total number of torrents allowed"
msgstr "允許新增的 Torrent 總數上限"

msgid "Hard limit on total active torrents (downloading + seeding + checking)"
msgstr "同時活躍（下載+做種+校驗）的硬上限"

msgid "0 = unlimited"
msgstr "0 = 不限制"

msgid "0 = unlimited"
msgstr "0 = 不限制"

msgid "When either the uploaded amount or share ratio limit is reached, the matching BT task is paused."
msgstr "滿足上傳量上限或分享率上限任一條件後，會暫停對應 BT 任務。"

msgid "0 or empty means no limit"
msgstr "填 0 或留空表示不限速"

msgid "For example, 2 pauses after uploaded bytes reach 2x downloaded bytes. Use 0 to disable the ratio limit."
msgstr "例如 2 表示上傳量達到已下載量的 2 倍後暫停；填 0 表示不按倍數限制。"

msgid "Seconds a peer must be unchoked before it can be flagged, avoiding penalising slow-start peers."
msgstr "對等端需被放開上傳這麼久後才可能被標記，避免誤傷剛接入的慢啟動對等端。"

msgid "Peers sending back less than this share of what they take are treated as leechers. 0 disables the ratio check."
msgstr "回傳資料低於其取得資料該比例的 peer 將被視為吸血者；填 0 關閉比例判斷。"

msgid "Seconds a banned peer stays banned before it is unbanned and may reconnect."
msgstr "被封禁對等端需等待的秒數，到期後自動解封可重新連線。"

msgid "Ban disconnects and blacklists offending peers for a while; Limit Slots caps how many peers a torrent uploads to at once."
msgstr "封禁：斷開並暫時拉黑違規對等端；限制上傳槽位：當 torrent 有吸血對等端時限制同時上傳的槽位數。"

msgid "When a torrent has detected leechers, its concurrent upload slots are capped at this value."
msgstr "當 torrent 檢測到吸血對等端時，其併發上傳槽位將限制為該值。"

msgid "Periodically identify peers that download from you without giving data back, then enforce the selected action."
msgstr "定期識別只下載卻不回傳資料的對等端，並按所選策略處理。"

msgid "Load a peer IP blocklist into the session. Blocked ranges (e.g. known leeching IDC/networks) are refused on connection."
msgstr "將會話的 IP 過濾設為黑名單檔案中的網段，被封段的（如已知吸血 IDC/網路）連線將被拒絕。"

msgid "Path to a blocklist file. Use an eMule .dat file or a P2P plaintext file (one CIDR per line); format is chosen by file extension."
msgstr "填寫黑名單檔案路徑。支援 eMule .dat 或 P2P 明文（每行一個 CIDR）格式，按副檔名自動選擇解析器。"

msgid "How peers are ranked while seeding. Anti-Leech prefers seeding peers that contribute the most back."
msgstr "做種時對 peer 的排序方式。反吸血優先回報最高的做種對等端。"

msgid "How unchoke slots are determined per torrent. Fixed keeps a constant slot count; Rate-based auto-adjusts."
msgstr "每個 torrent 的 unchoke 槽位如何確定：固定槽位數 或 按速率自動調整。"

msgid "Maximum concurrent unchoke slots per torrent."
msgstr "每個 torrent 的最大併發 unchoke 槽位數。"

msgid "Hash-failure involvements before a peer is automatically banned."
msgstr "hash 校驗失敗的涉事次數超過該值後自動封禁該 peer。"

msgid "Re-download a failed piece from an uninvolved peer to attribute the fault before striking."
msgstr "從無關 peer 重新下載失敗分片以判定責任，判責前不扣分。"

msgid "Seconds an evicted (non-contributing) peer is blocked from reconnecting."
msgstr "被驅逐（不貢獻資料的）peer 需等待的封禁秒數，到期後可重新連線。"

msgid "Seconds without receiving piece data before a peer is disconnected. 0 disables this safeguard."
msgstr "超過該秒數未收到分片資料的 peer 將被斷開；填 0 關閉此保護。"

msgid "Enable double-buffer pool optimization for mechanical hard drives to improve write performance. Not needed for SSDs."
msgstr "為機械硬碟啟用雙緩衝池最佳化，提升寫入效能。SSD 不需要此功能。"

msgid "Maximum memory used to buffer HDD downloads. A larger buffer turns more random writes into sequential writes."
msgstr "HDD 下載時用於緩衝的記憶體上限。更大的緩衝區可將更多隨機寫入轉化為順序寫入。"

msgid "Buffer limit when game mode is active, reducing impact on gaming performance."
msgstr "遊戲模式啟用時的緩衝區上限，降低對遊戲效能的影響。"

msgid "Maximum number of HDD downloads that can use the buffer simultaneously. Each gets an equal share of the buffer pool."
msgstr "可同時使用緩衝區的 HDD 下載數量上限。每個下載均分緩衝池。"

msgid "Maximum parallel HDD downloads when game mode is active."
msgstr "遊戲模式啟用時的最大並行 HDD 下載數。"

msgid "Supports absolute or relative paths. Leave empty to write to logs/limedl.log under app data."
msgstr "支援絕對路徑或相對路徑；留空時自動寫入應用資料目錄下的 logs/limedl.log。"

msgid "Start a local Aria2 RPC-compatible server, allowing Chrome download extensions to send downloads via the Aria2 protocol."
msgstr "在本地啟動相容 Aria2 RPC 的服務端，允許 Chrome 下載外掛透過 Aria2 協議發起下載。"

msgid "Default 6800. Make sure the port is available."
msgstr "預設 6800。確保埠未被其他程式佔用。"

msgid "Leave empty to allow connections without a secret. If set, configure the same token in your browser extension."
msgstr "留空允許無金鑰連線。設定後需在外掛中配置相同 token。"

